OL,3,GNEWSADavid Chadwick confirmed as new
OL,4,Aleader of Welsh Lib Dems
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Chadwick has been confirmed as
OL,7,Fthe new leader of the Welsh Liberal
OL,8,FDemocrats.
OL,10,FThe 34-year-old became MP for Brecon,
OL,11,FRadnor and Cwm Tawe two years ago, and
OL,12,Ftakes over from the party's only member
OL,13,Fof the Senedd Jane Dodds, who stood
OL,14,Fdown after nine years in charge.
OL,16,FWith only one elected representative in
OL,17,Fthe Welsh Parliament and one in the
OL,18,FHouse of Commons, Chadwick was the only
OL,19,Fperson eligible to stand.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
