OL,3,GNEWSADavid Chadwick confirmed as new
OL,4,Aleader of Welsh Lib Dems
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, Chadwick said he wanted to
OL,7,F"lead the Welsh Liberal Democrats into
OL,8,Fthe next chapter of our history",
OL,9,Fpromising to rebuild the party as a
OL,10,F"political force capable of shaping the
OL,11,Ffuture of Wales".
